  <item>
    <title>Ep11.在南极探险邮轮上工作是一种什么样的体验？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664265fa251bd96e6c130a53</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664265fa251bd96e6c130a53</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 May 2024 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>提到南极，你会想到什么，纪录片、企鹅、冰川？亦或是高昂的旅行团费用？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期播客将会从一个新奇的职业视角为你提供</span><strong><span>南极的新型打开方式</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾Dannie在19岁时独自背上行囊前往南极，在邮轮上做了四个月的服务生，不仅拿着丰厚的薪资，还能领略极地风光，认识来自世界各地的朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>大二的她为什么选择去南极？在邮轮上的工作生活是什么样的？对Dannie的人生有着哪些改变？</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>有哪些渠道可以找到南极探险邮轮的工作机会，难不难？</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>🪩</span><em><strong><span>在这一期你将听到：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="83">01:23</a> 大二为什么选择Gap year一年？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 谁给了她Gap去南极的勇气？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">04:53</a> “我希望能够弄清楚我到底想要什么”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 如何思考⬆️这个问题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">07:17</a> 哪些渠道可以申请南极探险邮轮的工作机会？工资？难吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">09:49</a> 更专业的职业：南极探险队员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">10:48</a> 因为“求婚”结下的缘分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">12:12</a> 彻底爱上了：徒步成了我“非做不可”的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 和纽约女生凌晨五点体验浪漫日出🌄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 当我打开自己的社交圈后：拥抱善意、增长信心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1091">18:11</a> 如何学会独处？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1227">20:27</a> 建立自己生活的秩序：自律即自由</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家进听友群一起感受人生的多种可能性，解锁台前幕后更多故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>（扫描下方二维码或添加微信ichliebemich23 记得备注听友群~谢谢大家的支持！）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg_0EXYCrg8L7JAw-6jzGOkQ4Hm1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>/BGM List/</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. sum - fsb02takuya</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. Snowy Morning - FREDERIC BOUCHAL</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 寄夏予你 - TsingYuenn</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. It is All Your Imagination - Ivaylo Tsvetanov</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们下期见~</span></p>]]></description>
